PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION: In this striking large-scale triptych, contemporary artist Shahin Zonoozi reimagines the iconic type 930 Porsche 911 Turbo through a bold graphic lens. Rendered in deep midnight tones against a vivid orange field, the car’s silhouette becomes sculptural, emphasizing the aerodynamic purity of the 930’s legendary form. Precise line work, controlled highlights, and disciplined geometry reflect Zoonozi’s background in engineering and design, while the saturated palette gives the piece an unmistakably modern presence. “The triptych format creates a sense of reverence, as if the car becomes a modern relic,” Zonoozi says. Each of the three panels measures 36 inches by 48 inches for a combined measurement of 9 feet by 4 feet., All proceeds of the sale will go to Genius Garage, a 501c3 nonprofit educational charity that develops hands-on skills and provides practical work experience in aerospace, racing, automotive design, and social media content creation for a select group of college students. For more information, please visit the website, .

LOT_SUMMARY: Acrylic on canvas in three panels, Depicts the type 930 Porsche 911 Turbo through a bold graphic lens, All proceeds go to Genius Garage, a 501c3 nonprofit educational charity, 9 × 4 ft. (each panel is 36 × 48 in.)

