uipment includes front and rear cameras, passenger display, suspension lifter, and a high-power hi-fi system. As indicated by an invoice on file, Scottsdale Ferrari-Maserati performed an oil and filter change, brake flush, and systems check in February 2024., Accompanied by a car cover, seat covers, steering wheel cover, battery tender, and copy of its window sticker, this one-of-one 12-cylinder Ferrari has been driven just 306 miles as of cataloguing time and remains in outstanding condition throughout. It is ideal for the connoisseur who favors a highly bespoke, singular specification in the most exclusive Tailor Made colors and trim—as striking to behold as it is to drive.

