PRODUCT_DESCRIPTION: In late 2020, Ferrari announced its “Ispirazioni” collection of special liveries designed to showcase the degree of personalization and close client collaboration its exclusive Tailor Made department offers. Inspired by classic Ferrari models, legendary racecars, and more abstract themes, three of the company’s models—the Roma, SF90 Stradale, and 812 GTS—each received 12 specially “inspired” liveries, for a total of 36 examples in the collection., Offered here is one of 12 total 812 GTS models created as part of the Tailor Made "Ispirazioni" collection and what is believed to be the only example from the collection “inspired by raw aluminum,” as inscribed on a matte carbon fiber Tailor Made dedication plate affixed to the rear bulkhead between the seats. Like a shapely ingot of the lightweight alloy, the car is finished in Matte Grigio Coburn, offset by a thin Bianco King central stripe overlaying a wider Nero stripe. The one-off specification also features extensive use of matte carbon fiber, including for the front bumper valance, rear bumper sides, rear diffuser, the underside of the doors, inner door handles, driver zone and bridge, kick panels, dashboard inserts, and console. Matte black forged racing wheels, yellow brake calipers, and airbrushed Scuderia Ferrari fender shields further dress the exterior., Bringing cohesion to the presentation, the interior mirrors the exterior treatment with strips of Bianco leather on the center console, instrument binnacle, and streaking down the middle of the size-large carbon racing seats, which are upholstered in high-tech Charcoal Ultrasuede with two-tone Black and Yellow “3D” Aunde sail fabric inserts. Bianco Cavallino logos embroidered on each headrest, along with a white rev counter and Giallo contrast stitching throughout the interior further enhance the presentation. Matte carbon fiber kick plates on the door sills feature the Tailor Made logo and “Ispirazioni” collection name., Other notable equipment includes front and rear cameras, passenger display, suspension lifter, and a high-power hi-fi system. As indicated by an invoice on file, Scottsdale Ferrari-Maserati performed an oil and filter change, brake flush, and systems check in February 2024., Accompanied by a car cover, seat covers, steering wheel cover, battery tender, and copy of its window sticker, this one-of-one 12-cylinder Ferrari has been driven just 306 miles as of cataloguing time and remains in outstanding condition throughout. It is ideal for the connoisseur who favors a highly bespoke, singular specification in the most exclusive Tailor Made colors and trim—as striking to behold as it is to drive.

LOT_SUMMARY: One of 36 Ferraris created for the “Ispirazioni” Tailor Made collection and the only example finished in Matte Grigio Coburn with Nero and Bianco King stripes, Charcoal Ultrasuede interior with Bianco leather accents and Giallo contrast stitching, Well-optioned with extensive matte carbon fiber trim throughout and other factory upgrades, Showing just 306 actual miles at the time of cataloguing, A supremely collectable and incredibly powerful flagship GT

